  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>AKS uses outbound types to customize egress for a cluster to fit specific scenarios.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can now use Azure CLI to migrate outbound types on existing clusters based on your needs, without having to recreate a cluster.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/egress-outboundtype#updating-outboundtype-after-cluster-creation-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "AKS uses outbound types to customize egress for a cluster to fit specific scenarios.\n\nYou can now use Azure CLI to migrate outbound types on existing clusters based on your needs, without having to recreate a cluster.\n\nLearn more"
  },
